    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Uber Technologies, Inc. is a publicly traded company (ticker UBER) headquartered in San Francisco, California. Its own site presents the Uber platform and apps as tools for earning, eating, commuting, getting a ride, and simplifying business travel. The company also says it is introducing autonomous vehicles on Uber, describing a safety-driven approach that combines autonomous vehicles and drivers, developed with industry partners.\n\nThe site's language is promotional, framing autonomous vehicles as a key part of a reimagined future of movement and promising a best-in-class experience. No specific AI products are tracked for the company in the available record.\n\nThe company's litigation record shows 281 cases in California. Its SEC filing identifier is CIK 0001543151.",
